{"id":"n61273-1-9","stage":3,"title":"사자 · 狮子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61273-1-9-1","ko":"나는 동물 중에서 사자가 제일 좋아.","zh":"在所有的动物里，我最喜欢狮子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"동물","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物。","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"2","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}},{"text":"중에서","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에서","audio":"/audio/032e02e648360996d6a6.mp3"}},{"text":"사자가","meaning":"狮子","explanation":"사자：狮子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사자","audio":"/audio/df410774e3dd128a2f39.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61273","senseId":"1","lemma":"사자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사자가","audio":"/audio/0d049c543dd20f3393ac.mp3"}},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最。","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"除人类以外的飞禽走兽、游鱼爬虫等可以行动的生物。","pronunciation":["동ː물"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"df410774e3dd128a","term":"사자","zh":"狮子","audio":"/audio/df410774e3dd128a2f39.mp3","entryId":"61273","definition":"体型大而凶狠的动物，雄性的脑后与胸前长有长长的鬃毛。","pronunciation":["사자"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b508545f1b7ddde9903.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61273-1-9-2","ko":"나도. 특히 얼굴이랑 목에 난 갈기가 제일 멋있어.","zh":"我也是。尤其是它脸上和脖子上的鬃毛，看起来最帅了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도.","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"특히","meaning":"特别，尤其，尤为","explanation":"특히：特别，尤其，尤为。","readings":[{"term":"특히","audio":"/audio/56aef31d9ebf1888daf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71300","senseId":"1","lemma":"특히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"특히","audio":"/audio/56aef31d9ebf1888daf3.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이랑","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；이랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이랑","audio":"/audio/5cc66aeca89704aaeb6a.mp3"}},{"text":"목에","meaning":"脖子，颈","explanation":"목：脖子，颈；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"1","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목에","audio":"/audio/fb59b7ce3500a3bfa3aa.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"长出，发，生","explanation":"나다：长出，发，生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"갈기가","meaning":"鬃，鬣","explanation":"갈기：鬃，鬣；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"갈기","audio":"/audio/4c779a8c9e8cae4edc73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14577","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈기가","audio":"/audio/1d0fc6f92025aa0705ed.mp3"}},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最。","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}},{"text":"멋있어.","meaning":"帅气，优秀","explanation":"멋있다：帅气，优秀；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋있어","audio":"/audio/f2799ee0ae7edb940632.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"56aef31d9ebf1888","term"